  "system": {
    "identifier": "shakuton-scorch-release-murderous-flame",
    "description": "<p>You conjure super-heated chakra before firing a beam of white flame in a 30 feet long, 5 feet wide line. All creatures in its path must make a Constitution saving throw.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creatures take half of 3d8 fire damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take half of 3d8 fire damage and are Dazzled until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 3d8 fire damage and are overwhelmed by the heat causing them to be Confused.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but affected creatures take 4d8 fire damage.</p>\n<p>Scorch. By spending 2 Scorch Charges, this jutsu’s range instead becomes a 30-foot cone as the murderous flame fans out.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and damage by 1d8.</p>",
    "source": {
